<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.266" end="00:00:02.500" style="s2">Well, there she is.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.000" end="00:00:06.500" style="s2">The millionaire&#39;s mama, begging for rice on credit again.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.066" end="00:00:09.333" style="s2">Thursday, Opal. All at once. I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.800" end="00:00:16.400" style="s2">Mind your own business, Gwen.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.900" end="00:00:18.366" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t owe me a dime.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.200" end="00:00:31.200" style="s2">Dalton Whitlock.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.600" end="00:00:33.166" style="s2">Don&#39;t you go in there yet, son.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.700" end="00:00:35.533" style="s2">Your mama&#39;s inside with a fever,</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.600" end="00:00:37.300" style="s2">asking me for a pound of rice.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.133" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">Rice? I send her three thousand dollars a month.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.733" end="00:00:46.000" style="s2">And she&#39;s been buying rice on credit for seven months.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.733" end="00:00:48.766" style="s2">Every week it&#39;s &quot;Thursday, Opal.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.133" end="00:00:51.600" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t anybody call me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.400" end="00:00:54.200" style="s2">She made me swear I wouldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.266" end="00:00:57.866" style="s2">And somebody put a padlock on her pantry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.800" end="00:01:05.000" style="s2">Can&#39;t lose that one.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.466" end="00:01:08.400" style="s2">Mrs. Whitlock?</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.566" end="00:01:10.966" style="s2">Your dress for Maisie&#39;s graduation party is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.133" end="00:01:16.966" style="s2">Brandi. The old lady&#39;s money just hit.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.133" end="00:01:18.566" style="s2">Your usual goes out tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.866" end="00:01:20.066" style="s2">She never even asks.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.200" end="00:01:22.333" style="s2">Don&#39;t spend it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.666" end="00:01:25.200" style="s2">I need every penny for Saturday after next.</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.200" end="00:01:42.700" style="s2">You&#39;re not going after her?</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.333" end="00:01:45.366" style="s2">I don&#39;t want her to know I saw her like this.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.000" end="00:01:48.533" style="s2">How do you know about the padlock?</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.533" end="00:01:52.966" style="s2">Saw it at Christmas, when I brought her some soup.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.900" end="00:01:55.966" style="s2">I&#39;ll give her an hour.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.533" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">Then I&#39;m knocking on that door</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.800" end="00:01:59.133" style="s2">like I just got off the plane.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.300" end="00:02:10.600" style="s2">Dalton? You didn&#39;t tell me you were coming.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.933" end="00:02:13.600" style="s2">I haven&#39;t straightened up a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.000" end="00:02:14.900" style="s2">Sit, sit.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.400" end="00:02:17.066" style="s2">You still take two sugars?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.466" end="00:02:23.866" style="s2">Mama, what&#39;s that on the pantry?</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.700" end="00:02:27.933" style="s2">Oh, that. Mice were getting in.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.733" end="00:02:31.066" style="s2">Mice open doors now?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.500" end="00:02:37.266" style="s2">Drink your coffee before it gets cold.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.500" end="00:02:42.533" style="s2">Who has the key?</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.666" end="00:02:49.200" style="s2">Mama. Who has the key?</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.566" end="00:02:53.066" style="s2">Celeste keeps it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.200" end="00:02:57.600" style="s2">She says I eat at all hours and it&#39;s bad for me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.866" end="00:03:03.666" style="s2">She says we have to be careful with the little that comes in.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.400" end="00:03:05.600" style="s2">The little that comes in.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.200" end="00:03:11.900" style="s2">Mama, I send you three thousand dollars</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.900" end="00:03:15.800" style="s2">on the first of every month. How much?</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.533" end="00:03:17.333" style="s2">Three thousand.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.800" end="00:03:19.900" style="s2">Every month. For three years.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.966" end="00:03:26.733" style="s2">She told me things were hard over</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.733" end="00:03:29.066" style="s2">there. That you sent what you could.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.600" end="00:03:31.200" style="s2">What else did she do to you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.533" end="00:03:34.333" style="s2">I asked her to forgive me, son.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.066" end="00:03:37.166" style="s2">I apologized to her for eating.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.900" end="00:03:45.200" style="s2">Don&#39;t be hard on her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.066" end="00:03:48.266" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t like me going out, that&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.300" end="00:03:50.766" style="s2">She says people talk.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.133" end="00:03:58.700" style="s2">Where&#39;s your fever medicine, Mama?</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.700" end="00:03:59.600" style="s2">Aspirin, anything?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.466" end="00:04:02.600" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.466" end="00:04:05.766" style="s2">It&#39;ll pass. It always does.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.566" end="00:04:20.000" style="s2">Figured you&#39;d be by tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.066" end="00:04:31.666" style="s2">I haven&#39;t had anything hot in a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.733" end="00:04:33.500" style="s2">Slow down, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.500" end="00:04:34.300" style="s2">There&#39;s more.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.666" end="00:04:40.133" style="s2">Look what you came home to.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.366" end="00:04:47.166" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to earn a meal</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.166" end="00:04:48.566" style="s2">in your own house, Mama. Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.266" end="00:04:56.133" style="s2">You just eat. Let me handle the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.066" end="00:05:14.333" style="s2">So I won&#39;t forget.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.600" end="00:05:18.200" style="s2">Because later you start thinking you made it up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.966" end="00:05:23.866" style="s2">Today she took my bank money. She</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.500" end="00:05:27.533" style="s2">says she&#39;ll keep it safe. I said yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.500" end="00:05:30.700" style="s2">I don&#39;t want trouble with my son&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.466" end="00:05:36.100" style="s2">I asked for a little meat.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.866" end="00:05:38.900" style="s2">She says at my age it&#39;s too heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.800" end="00:05:41.500" style="s2">She left rice and water.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.933" end="00:05:44.900" style="s2">It was good.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.533" end="00:05:48.200" style="s2">She brings me papers to sign.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.366" end="00:05:52.800" style="s2">She says they&#39;re for the pharmacy. I sign them.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.066" end="00:05:58.366" style="s2">October fourteenth.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.566" end="00:06:01.400" style="s2">She put a lock on the pantry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.133" end="00:06:02.533" style="s2">She says</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.630" end="00:06:03.830" style="s2">I eat too much.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.766" end="00:06:08.466" style="s2">The sewing machine is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.266" end="00:06:10.866" style="s2">She said it made too much noise.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.800" end="00:06:14.666" style="s2">My Harold bought it for me with his first paycheck.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.733" end="00:06:16.766" style="s2">But she&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.266" end="00:06:19.966" style="s2">Nobody orders dresses anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.533" end="00:06:26.366" style="s2">I called Dalton five times.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.366" end="00:06:27.466" style="s2">It won&#39;t go through.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.766" end="00:06:32.300" style="s2">Maybe I don&#39;t know how to work these phones. I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.500" end="00:06:39.966" style="s2">Today I am seventy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.000" end="00:06:43.166" style="s2">I ate yesterday&#39;s rice by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.866" end="00:06:45.766" style="s2">I&#39;m too old for parties anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.766" end="00:06:49.066" style="s2">My Sunday dress hangs on me now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.700" end="00:06:54.000" style="s2">Whoever reads this,</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.000" end="00:06:55.200" style="s2">don&#39;t tell Dalton.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.000" end="00:06:58.400" style="s2">He sends what he can.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.500" end="00:06:59.866" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to be a burden.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.466" end="00:07:18.466" style="s2">How&#39;d she do? Fever broke around three.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.800" end="00:07:19.800" style="s2">She&#39;s still sleeping.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.366" end="00:07:29.000" style="s2">She made me swear the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.000" end="00:07:30.466" style="s2">I never had your number, son.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.600" end="00:07:32.700" style="s2">Seven months, Opal.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.100" end="00:07:34.533" style="s2">Why&#39;d you carry her that long?</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.100" end="00:07:39.333" style="s2">Your mama sewed my Rosie&#39;s wedding dress.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.533" end="00:07:42.000" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t pay her a cent,</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.066" end="00:07:43.866" style="s2">and she wouldn&#39;t have taken it anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.500" end="00:07:54.333" style="s2">I write the date and the time. Every time. In case</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.366" end="00:07:57.300" style="s2">somebody ever asked what was going on in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.566" end="00:08:00.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t lose that.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.400" end="00:08:02.600" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna need it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.900" end="00:08:04.100" style="s2">Then make copies.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.400" end="00:08:06.500" style="s2">The original doesn&#39;t leave my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.100" end="00:08:10.200" style="s2">And here&#39;s that bank form you sent me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.666" end="00:08:12.100" style="s2">Printed on the store machine.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.500" end="00:08:25.733" style="s2">Sign here, Mama, so the bank will</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.733" end="00:08:26.900" style="s2">let me look at your account.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.700" end="00:08:32.400" style="s2">What if Celeste finds out?</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.666" end="00:08:35.200" style="s2">She&#39;ll be mad.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.820" end="00:08:38.120" style="s2">Let her.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.066" end="00:08:42.200" style="s2">L-o-r-e-t-t-a.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.466" end="00:08:47.766" style="s2">Still slow as ever.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.800" end="00:08:51.533" style="s2">You learned at forty-one, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.700" end="00:08:52.866" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s rushing you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.100" end="00:08:57.366" style="s2">Dalton Whitlock?</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.733" end="00:08:59.133" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you supposed to be in Dubai?</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.933" end="00:09:02.800" style="s2">Got in yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.766" end="00:09:05.500" style="s2">My mother signed this this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.966" end="00:09:07.333" style="s2">I need to know where my money&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.333" end="00:09:08.533" style="s2">been going for three years.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.133" end="00:09:15.500" style="s2">Your transfers don&#39;t go to her old savings account.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.500" end="00:09:16.700" style="s2">They go into this one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.933" end="00:09:17.800" style="s2">&quot;Household account.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.566" end="00:09:21.400" style="s2">Celeste opened it three years ago</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.400" end="00:09:22.900" style="s2">with a power of attorney your mother signed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.600" end="00:09:24.800" style="s2">Celeste&#39;s a joint owner.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.100" end="00:09:27.266" style="s2">She can take money out without asking anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.066" end="00:09:30.866" style="s2">Then how did my money end up in there?</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.500" end="00:09:33.600" style="s2">You moved it there.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.866" end="00:09:34.766" style="s2">That&#39;s your signature.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.266" end="00:09:37.766" style="s2">The morning I flew out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.966" end="00:09:40.566" style="s2">She had a folder in her hand.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.566" end="00:09:43.066" style="s2">&quot;Sign here, babe, we&#39;re late.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.966" end="00:09:45.400" style="s2">I didn&#39;t even read it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.066" end="00:09:48.700" style="s2">I handed her the key myself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.133" end="00:09:55.000" style="s2">The first sixteen months, the money</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.000" end="00:09:57.200" style="s2">came out in cash, a little at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.366" end="00:10:00.800" style="s2">The last twenty months, the day after every</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.800" end="00:10:03.066" style="s2">deposit, twenty-seven hundred goes out.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.333" end="00:10:06.066" style="s2">Same person every time. Brandi Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.000" end="00:10:07.900" style="s2">Brandi is her sister.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.366" end="00:10:11.000" style="s2">That&#39;s fifty-four thousand dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.100" end="00:10:13.366" style="s2">If you go after this,</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.366" end="00:10:15.866" style="s2">you&#39;ll have to prove it wasn&#39;t some family arrangement.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.700" end="00:10:17.800" style="s2">Then show me everything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.666" end="00:10:26.266" style="s2">There&#39;s more. Your mother has three loans in her name.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.866" end="00:10:27.766" style="s2">Thirty-eight thousand.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.533" end="00:10:30.466" style="s2">The application says she owns a business.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.900" end="00:10:32.000" style="s2">Loretta&#39;s Alterations.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.700" end="00:10:34.166" style="s2">Ninety-six thousand a year.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.666" end="00:10:39.100" style="s2">My mother doesn&#39;t even have a sewing machine anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.666" end="00:10:46.466" style="s2">The money went to that dress shop</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.466" end="00:10:48.466" style="s2">on Main and a deposit at the Oakwood Room.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.400" end="00:10:51.566" style="s2">The Oakwood Room.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.533" end="00:10:54.266" style="s2">That&#39;s where my daughter&#39;s party is.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.166" end="00:10:59.966" style="s2">The first two loans were done online, with a scan of her ID.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.666" end="00:11:05.866" style="s2">The third came through right here at the counter.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.400" end="00:11:08.800" style="s2">Already signed, with your mother&#39;s license.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.133" end="00:11:12.500" style="s2">I remember her. Thirties,</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.266" end="00:11:14.266" style="s2">bleached blonde,</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.733" end="00:11:15.666" style="s2">big earrings.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.533" end="00:11:17.766" style="s2">Said your mother was sick</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.066" end="00:11:19.133" style="s2">and she was the daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.000" end="00:11:21.600" style="s2">A new teller pushed it through.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.000" end="00:11:25.400" style="s2">My mother doesn&#39;t have a daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.900" end="00:11:35.866" style="s2">The one on the loans is fast. Confident.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.700" end="00:11:38.300" style="s2">This one, from this morning,</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.466" end="00:11:41.333" style="s2">is one letter at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.000" end="00:11:44.066" style="s2">Whoever signed the loans has been</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.066" end="00:11:45.600" style="s2">signing their name all their life.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.100" end="00:11:47.266" style="s2">Your mother hasn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.066" end="00:11:50.666" style="s2">I need copies of all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.933" end="00:11:51.733" style="s2">Already printing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.366" end="00:11:58.166" style="s2">I&#39;m looking for a treadle machine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.933" end="00:11:59.966" style="s2">An old Singer.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.066" end="00:12:03.666" style="s2">Whitlock? You&#39;re Loretta&#39;s boy.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.166" end="00:12:07.066" style="s2">The lady who sewed every wedding dress in this county.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.266" end="00:12:14.366" style="s2">Who sold you this?</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.533" end="00:12:18.000" style="s2">Fancy lady. December.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.566" end="00:12:20.333" style="s2">Pulled up in a black SUV,</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.333" end="00:12:21.566" style="s2">some fella driving.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.166" end="00:12:24.066" style="s2">He&#39;s the one carried it in for her.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.100" end="00:12:27.533" style="s2">She said it belonged to her late mother-in-law.</p>
