<p begin="00:24:22.133" end="00:24:23.533" style="s2">What is she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.600" end="00:24:26.200" style="s2">You said she wasn&#39;t coming!</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.200" end="00:24:31.166" style="s2">Relax. That woman never opens her mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.700" end="00:24:34.800" style="s2">Is that Opal Grimes?</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.800" end="00:24:35.800" style="s2">Who invited her?</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.133" end="00:24:52.533" style="s2">You sit right here, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.966" end="00:25:01.900" style="s2">Proud of you, kiddo.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.200" end="00:25:05.333" style="s2">Dr. Fisk! You didn&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.366" end="00:25:08.400" style="s2">Baby, this is Dr. Vernon Fisk.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.466" end="00:25:09.666" style="s2">An old family friend.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.300" end="00:25:21.300" style="s2">Everybody, please welcome our newest nurse,</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.366" end="00:25:22.300" style="s2">Maisie Whitlock!</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.700" end="00:25:26.166" style="s2">And now, a few words from her proud father.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.866" end="00:25:31.666" style="s2">Good evening.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.900" end="00:25:34.700" style="s2">Thank you all for coming out for Maisie.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.100" end="00:25:37.766" style="s2">My daughter waited tables every</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.766" end="00:25:39.466" style="s2">weekend to get through nursing school.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.133" end="00:25:41.666" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t be prouder of her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.333" end="00:25:48.566" style="s2">But first, I want to talk about what it means to be a parent.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.933" end="00:25:51.366" style="s2">My mother taught me that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.766" end="00:25:53.533" style="s2">The lady up front in the blue dress?</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.400" end="00:25:55.300" style="s2">That&#39;s my mama,</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.300" end="00:25:56.666" style="s2">Loretta Whitlock.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.933" end="00:25:58.133" style="s2">She&#39;s a seamstress.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.900" end="00:26:05.200" style="s2">She lost my father when she was thirty-three,</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.333" end="00:26:08.400" style="s2">and she raised me sewing at night.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.000" end="00:26:09.800" style="s2">Plenty of nights,</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.166" end="00:26:11.400" style="s2">all we had was rice.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.800" end="00:26:14.666" style="s2">I never once went to bed hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.133" end="00:26:18.066" style="s2">She ate whatever was left in the pot.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.200" end="00:26:22.000" style="s2">I&#39;ve been overseas three years,</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.133" end="00:26:23.533" style="s2">and I thought she was fine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.066" end="00:26:29.100" style="s2">Two weeks ago,</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.000" end="00:26:32.066" style="s2">I found this under her mattress.</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.300" end="00:26:37.766" style="s2">Dalton. What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.933" end="00:26:40.666" style="s2">I&#39;m going to read what my mother wrote.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.600" end="00:26:49.400" style="s2">Today I asked Opal for rice on credit.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.666" end="00:26:55.300" style="s2">She looked at me like I was a ghost. Maybe I am.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.766" end="00:26:58.266" style="s2">Today I am seventy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.166" end="00:27:01.166" style="s2">I ate yesterday&#39;s rice by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.733" end="00:27:05.166" style="s2">While somebody was picking out the flowers for this room,</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.566" end="00:27:08.600" style="s2">my mother was eating yesterday&#39;s rice.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.400" end="00:27:11.500" style="s2">Dalton, enough.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.966" end="00:27:13.166" style="s2">This is family business.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.700" end="00:27:18.400" style="s2">That&#39;s why I&#39;m saying it in front of the family.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.200" end="00:27:22.200" style="s2">Three thousand dollars,</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.966" end="00:27:24.333" style="s2">the first of every month.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.366" end="00:27:27.600" style="s2">For the last twenty months,</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.000" end="00:27:30.333" style="s2">almost all of it left the day after it landed.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.466" end="00:27:33.466" style="s2">Every time, it went to Brandi Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.800" end="00:27:35.733" style="s2">My wife&#39;s sister.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.066" end="00:27:38.333" style="s2">Fifty-four thousand dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.466" end="00:27:45.733" style="s2">Three loans in my mother&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.466" end="00:27:47.966" style="s2">One of them paid for this room.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.366" end="00:27:50.000" style="s2">My mother doesn&#39;t even have</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.000" end="00:27:51.166" style="s2">her sewing machine anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.733" end="00:27:55.366" style="s2">They sold it, and told the buyer she was dead.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.200" end="00:28:03.933" style="s2">This is the signature on those loans.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.000" end="00:28:06.666" style="s2">Fast. Confident.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.933" end="00:28:09.000" style="s2">This is my mother&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.866" end="00:28:11.400" style="s2">One letter at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.300" end="00:28:14.133" style="s2">She learned to write at forty-one.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.333" end="00:28:16.566" style="s2">She didn&#39;t sign those.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.500" end="00:28:30.133" style="s2">But there&#39;s one signature in this pile that is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.166" end="00:28:34.200" style="s2">I signed what my wife put in front of me without reading it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.300" end="00:28:36.366" style="s2">Because it was easy.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.466" end="00:28:39.733" style="s2">That part&#39;s on me,</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.400" end="00:28:41.666" style="s2">and I&#39;ll carry it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.566" end="00:28:46.466" style="s2">I handed over the responsibility and called it care.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.600" end="00:28:49.866" style="s2">That&#39;s a lie! She&#39;s confused!</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.933" end="00:28:53.200" style="s2">That old woman doesn&#39;t know what day it is,</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.200" end="00:28:55.066" style="s2">and you believe every word!</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.600" end="00:29:02.300" style="s2">Being old doesn&#39;t make her a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.100" end="00:29:15.266" style="s2">She knows exactly what day it is, ma&#39;am. So do I.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.200" end="00:29:18.533" style="s2">Seven months of rice on credit,</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.600" end="00:29:23.200" style="s2">and every date and every time is written right here.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.500" end="00:29:26.366" style="s2">And I saw that padlock you hung</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.366" end="00:29:28.900" style="s2">on her pantry with my own two eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.466" end="00:29:34.566" style="s2">My mother apologized to you for eating in her own house.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.966" end="00:29:37.166" style="s2">When she tried to call me,</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.166" end="00:29:37.966" style="s2">she couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.666" end="00:29:41.500" style="s2">You blocked her. Five months.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.133" end="00:29:49.000" style="s2">Mama, you don&#39;t have to keep quiet anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.700" end="00:29:53.566" style="s2">Please. Not here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.100" end="00:30:03.666" style="s2">Mama, your seat is at the head of the table.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.200" end="00:30:08.966" style="s2">Right here? In front of all these people?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.466" end="00:30:10.266" style="s2">Right here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.766" end="00:30:16.533" style="s2">Eat, Mama. As much as you want.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.766" end="00:30:19.900" style="s2">More bread, Grandma?</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.366" end="00:30:22.400" style="s2">Sit by me, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.933" end="00:30:36.300" style="s2">You all want to talk about papers?</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.533" end="00:30:37.333" style="s2">Here are mine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.766" end="00:30:42.966" style="s2">Dr. Vernon Fisk.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.500" end="00:30:44.733" style="s2">October fourteenth.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.166" end="00:30:50.166" style="s2">Moderate dementia. Memory loss, confusion, paranoia.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.133" end="00:30:54.500" style="s2">She gave me power of attorney three years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.966" end="00:30:56.266" style="s2">And last September,</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.800" end="00:30:59.933" style="s2">she signed this health care proxy. In front</p>
