<p begin="00:31:03.766" end="00:31:05.166" style="s2">She trusted me with everything.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.000" end="00:31:12.466" style="s2">Those loans? She signed them herself, before she got worse.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.500" end="00:31:13.566" style="s2">She just doesn&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.066" end="00:31:21.266" style="s2">And Brandi was paid to look in on her.</p>
