<p begin="00:31:43.766" end="00:31:45.533" style="s2">I&#39;m filing for guardianship.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.600" end="00:31:50.333" style="s2">And the man who left her alone</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.333" end="00:31:53.200" style="s2">for three years doesn&#39;t get a say.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.800" end="00:31:57.333" style="s2">Maybe Celeste really was looking after her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.533" end="00:32:06.300" style="s2">You will not touch her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.100" end="00:32:09.166" style="s2">Watch me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.500" end="00:32:27.166" style="s2">Is Loretta Whitlock home, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.333" end="00:32:29.000" style="s2">I have an order from the probate court.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.266" end="00:32:34.066" style="s2">Emergency temporary guardianship.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.466" end="00:32:36.133" style="s2">Celeste Whitlock is appointed</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.300" end="00:32:39.000" style="s2">temporary guardian of Loretta Whitlock.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.133" end="00:32:42.366" style="s2">Mrs. Whitlock is to be placed at Magnolia Care for evaluation.</p>
