<p begin="00:32:50.366" end="00:32:52.700" style="s2">And sir, the guardian has asked Magnolia</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.700" end="00:32:54.333" style="s2">to hold family visits until the hearing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.800" end="00:32:57.600" style="s2">She&#39;s my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.533" end="00:33:00.566" style="s2">Then take it up with the judge on Friday, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.066" end="00:33:02.600" style="s2">I&#39;m doing what&#39;s best for her.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.100" end="00:33:04.366" style="s2">You had all this ready.</p>
