<p begin="00:33:09.766" end="00:33:11.866" style="s2">You didn&#39;t put this together over a weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.533" end="00:33:14.600" style="s2">I planned for her care,</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.600" end="00:33:16.533" style="s2">Dalton. Somebody had to.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.533" end="00:33:28.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t fight them, son.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.566" end="00:33:32.400" style="s2">Don&#39;t make a scene. Not over me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.200" end="00:33:35.066" style="s2">Friday, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.500" end="00:33:36.766" style="s2">I&#39;ll be there Friday.</p>
