<p begin="00:50:17.333" end="00:50:19.200" style="s2">Dr. Fisk examined you</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.200" end="00:50:20.800" style="s2">at his office on October fourteenth,</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.866" end="00:50:22.133" style="s2">at ten-thirty in the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.066" end="00:50:26.200" style="s2">I&#39;ve never set foot in that man&#39;s office.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.900" end="00:50:28.700" style="s2">I&#39;ve only seen him out my window,</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.666" end="00:50:31.300" style="s2">waiting in his car for her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.400" end="00:50:33.666" style="s2">And in December,</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.533" end="00:50:36.800" style="s2">carrying my sewing machine out to it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.000" end="00:50:39.133" style="s2">She&#39;s right, Your Honor.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.566" end="00:50:43.200" style="s2">I saw him carry it. From her porch, at Christmas.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.933" end="00:50:49.533" style="s2">State your name for the record, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.066" end="00:50:51.800" style="s2">Gwen Tabor. I was selling raffle tickets.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.766" end="00:50:55.100" style="s2">Note that.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.266" end="00:50:56.900" style="s2">Your Honor, I&#39;d like to call Opal Grimes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.500" end="00:50:58.533" style="s2">She keeps a record.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.500" end="00:51:05.900" style="s2">October fourteenth,</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.300" end="00:51:07.733" style="s2">ten-twenty a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.266" end="00:51:09.533" style="s2">Loretta Whitlock.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.933" end="00:51:11.100" style="s2">One pound of rice.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.600" end="00:51:12.600" style="s2">Running a fever.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.900" end="00:51:15.100" style="s2">My store&#39;s forty minutes from his office.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.066" end="00:51:18.333" style="s2">That was the morning she put the lock on.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.266" end="00:51:20.800" style="s2">There was nothing in the house,</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.566" end="00:51:23.166" style="s2">so I walked to Opal&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.166" end="00:51:25.600" style="s2">It&#39;s in my book, too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.533" end="00:51:33.100" style="s2">Seven months she was buying rice from me on credit.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.966" end="00:51:35.700" style="s2">If somebody got fifty-four</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.700" end="00:51:37.566" style="s2">thousand dollars to look in on her,</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.600" end="00:51:39.666" style="s2">they never once bought her a meal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.100" end="00:51:46.533" style="s2">My receptionist must have...</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.666" end="00:51:47.600" style="s2">Sit down, Doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.700" end="00:51:57.933" style="s2">The proxy is dated September thirtieth of last year.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.900" end="00:52:00.700" style="s2">Two weeks before the diagnosis.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.533" end="00:52:04.266" style="s2">But look at the bottom of the page, Your Honor.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.533" end="00:52:09.333" style="s2">This version of the form came out this February.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.466" end="00:52:12.833" style="s2">This form didn&#39;t exist last September.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.133" end="00:52:17.766" style="s2">I was standing in the hall closet three Saturdays ago.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.333" end="00:52:19.933" style="s2">I watched my mother sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.500" end="00:52:22.200" style="s2">She was told it was for the pharmacy.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.900" end="00:52:24.333" style="s2">And not to bother with the date.</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.933" end="00:52:39.066" style="s2">She wrote &quot;So I won&#39;t forget.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.600" end="00:52:41.333" style="s2">Those are her words, not mine.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.666" end="00:52:46.700" style="s2">I wrote it down because she kept</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.766" end="00:52:48.733" style="s2">telling me I imagined things.</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.100" end="00:52:53.933" style="s2">A woman who forgets doesn&#39;t write down</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.933" end="00:52:55.966" style="s2">the date of every time she went hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.866" end="00:53:01.933" style="s2">And where was her son all this time?</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.200" end="00:53:05.266" style="s2">A millionaire since last fall,</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.900" end="00:53:07.766" style="s2">and his mother living on rice?</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.400" end="00:53:10.066" style="s2">In Dubai, working.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.266" end="00:53:12.566" style="s2">He should have come home.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.700" end="00:53:15.400" style="s2">I&#39;m angry at him for that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.900" end="00:53:20.133" style="s2">But being angry at my son doesn&#39;t make me crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.300" end="00:53:29.600" style="s2">Your Honor, I&#39;m Maisie Whitlock.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.700" end="00:53:33.500" style="s2">I&#39;m a nurse at Magnolia Care.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.600" end="00:53:36.200" style="s2">My mother told me to write</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.200" end="00:53:37.566" style="s2">that Grandma didn&#39;t recognize me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.900" end="00:53:39.166" style="s2">She recognized me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.866" end="00:53:41.133" style="s2">She asked if I&#39;d eaten.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.666" end="00:53:44.933" style="s2">I&#39;m the nurse who reported the lorazepam.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.900" end="00:53:46.700" style="s2">Maisie!</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.466" end="00:53:51.266" style="s2">You told me if I ever said anything,</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.400" end="00:53:54.533" style="s2">Dad would stop loving me. He didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.866" end="00:54:01.466" style="s2">The petition is denied.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.066" end="00:54:04.166" style="s2">The emergency order is vacated.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.733" end="00:54:06.733" style="s2">Mrs. Whitlock goes home today.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.200" end="00:54:09.466" style="s2">This file goes to the district attorney,</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.566" end="00:54:12.566" style="s2">and I&#39;m reporting Dr. Fisk to the state medical board.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.100" end="00:54:16.000" style="s2">She&#39;s competent.</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.366" end="00:54:18.800" style="s2">Her revocation stands. No sale.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.866" end="00:54:27.566" style="s2">Your Honor, may I take my name back off those papers?</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.900" end="00:54:40.733" style="s2">Take your time,</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.733" end="00:54:41.766" style="s2">Mrs. Whitlock.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.700" end="00:54:46.733" style="s2">Celeste Whitlock,</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.100" end="00:54:49.200" style="s2">you&#39;re under arrest for forgery,</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.700" end="00:54:50.533" style="s2">identity theft,</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.666" end="00:54:52.733" style="s2">and exploitation of an elder adult.</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.600" end="00:55:00.400" style="s2">Dr. Vernon Fisk, you&#39;re under arrest for falsifying</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.400" end="00:55:02.100" style="s2">a medical certificate and elder abuse.</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.900" end="00:55:10.133" style="s2">It was her idea!</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.133" end="00:55:12.700" style="s2">I just went to the bank!</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.400" end="00:55:16.333" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, tell it to your lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.866" end="00:55:26.666" style="s2">I did everything for this family.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.666" end="00:55:29.266" style="s2">You did everything to it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.266" end="00:55:34.600" style="s2">Maisie. I&#39;m your father.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.733" end="00:55:37.666" style="s2">I have a father.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.933" end="00:55:46.100" style="s2">Thursday, Opal. All at once. Like I said.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.533" end="00:55:47.900" style="s2">You don&#39;t owe me a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.133" end="00:55:49.866" style="s2">That&#39;s exactly why I&#39;m paying.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.366" end="00:55:57.000" style="s2">Loretta. I said things in this store I&#39;m ashamed of.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.300" end="00:56:01.166" style="s2">Then pay your tab, Gwen. Opal&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.166" end="00:56:03.266" style="s2">patient with you a lot longer than with me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.766" end="00:56:06.066" style="s2">Three pages, Gwen.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.200" end="00:56:07.600" style="s2">Thursday works for you too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.266" end="00:56:16.766" style="s2">All three loans are frozen. No payments,</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.766" end="00:56:17.600" style="s2">no collections,</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.766" end="00:56:20.000" style="s2">nothing on your credit while the forgery case runs.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.066" end="00:56:22.100" style="s2">Once it&#39;s proven,</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.600" end="00:56:24.166" style="s2">they come off your name for good.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.466" end="00:56:26.466" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll wait.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.000" end="00:56:28.000" style="s2">I&#39;m good at waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.200" end="00:56:37.133" style="s2">Teach me, Grandma?</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.400" end="00:56:42.466" style="s2">First, a straight line. You rush.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.800" end="00:56:44.300" style="s2">Just like your daddy did.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.000" end="00:56:46.300" style="s2">I&#39;ll set it all up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.500" end="00:56:47.866" style="s2">A nurse twice a week,</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.933" end="00:56:50.066" style="s2">the bills on autopay, a new phone...</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.066" end="00:56:53.066" style="s2">Ask me first.</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.666" end="00:56:58.666" style="s2">You didn&#39;t have to give up your work for me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.266" end="00:57:00.400" style="s2">I sold my half.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.466" end="00:57:03.366" style="s2">I should have come home three years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.466" end="00:57:06.133" style="s2">You never left me alone, son.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.933" end="00:57:10.133" style="s2">I did, Mama. I sent money.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.466" end="00:57:13.500" style="s2">Money doesn&#39;t sit at the table with you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.333" end="00:57:15.133" style="s2">Then sit.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.933" end="00:57:22.466" style="s2">Turn on the porch light, son.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.100" end="00:57:25.133" style="s2">Let folks see somebody lives here.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
